## Final takeaway

You may not control every circumstance you face, but you can often influence how you respond to it.

Take care of your body, manage stress, build supportive relationships, question limiting beliefs, and create an environment that helps you thrive. At the same time, respect the limits of personal control: genetics, illness, and many life circumstances cannot simply be overcome through belief.

That is the most practical lesson to take from The Biology of Belief.
